# Media policy per fellows/README.md, rule of 2026-09-18 (Bear):
# renders stay OUT, build inputs stay IN — excluded by LOCATION, not file type.
#
# OUT — produced by the pipeline from the beat sheet:
mp3/
audio/
media/
clips/
renders/
mp4/
_qc/
_work/

# IN, deliberately NOT ignored — these are build inputs the reel cannot be
# reproduced without, all well under GitHub's 100 MB cap:
#   pantry/      the native 9:16 portrait overrides. shorts.py's default
#                centre-cut discards 68% of frame width and destroys every
#                two-column slide in the deck; these are the fix.
#   timings.json the measured clock each beat was conformed to. Kept at the
#                folder root rather than mp3/, because mp3/ is an excluded
#                location and git will not descend into it.

# Build venv / caches
.venv/
__pycache__/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
